name low_bandwidth
describe 150 kbps link: audio must stay clean, video degrades gracefully
# 40 seeds in compare-webrtc (#859): seed 10's end-of-call video pause is one seed in 40.
compare_seeds 40
duration 40s
at 0s capacity=150kbps delay=40ms queue=500ms
# Known gap: audio queues behind video in the bottleneck; mouth-to-ear delay ~1 s.
expect audio.concealed_pct < 5
